      "end": 4552,
      "groups": [
        "p044-textual-coordination-247fc44e29"
      ],
      "sourceText": "إِسْتَبْرَقٍ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p044-u0033",
      "text": "در آنجا مرگ را نمی چشند، مرگ آنان همان مرگی بود که در دنیا چشیدند، و",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(4) > p:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(3)",
      "textHash": "a1f5acef58da84935e46cadf4808c7701d5ddde42ca3a9971f422662c675914b",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-180 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 56,
      "blockIndex": 12,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": "p044-s0004",
      "contextId": "p044-c12",
      "start": 4772,
      "end": 4842,
      "groups": [
        "p044-textual-coordination-e15e958cc7"
      ],
      "sourceText": "لَا يَذُوقُونَ فِيهَا الْمَوْتَ إِلَّا الْمَوْتَةَ الْأُولَىٰ"
    },
    {
      "id": "p044-u0034",
      "text": "آنان را از عذاب دوزخ مصون می دارد.",
      "selector": "body:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(3) > div:nth-of-type(4) > p:nth-of-type(1) > span:nth-of-type(4)",
      "textHash": "72cd9e1977e1e4ce03d88aeef8f3c0773be16b8e9695f934bff37e6704c54555",
      "appearance": {
        "signature": "ul-color-gray-180 ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "structure": "ul-pad-x-0px ul-pad-y-0px ul-pattern-solid ul-sides-open ul-thickness-1px",
        "colorFamily": "gray"
      },
      "verse": 56,
      "blockIndex": 12,
      "parentId": null,
      "sectionId": "p044-s0004",
      "contextId": "p044-c12",
